OL,3,ABurnham to push for new post-Brexit
OL,4,Adeals at EU summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has told
OL,7,FMPs he will push for new post-Brexit
OL,8,Fdeals with the EU at a summit next
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FHe said "deeper cooperation" on some
OL,12,Fkey issues - including youth mobility,
OL,13,Ffood and drink, and energy - would help
OL,14,Fdrive economic growth in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1791834927
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham to push for new post-Brexit
OL,4,Adeals at EU summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement to MPs, Burnham also
OL,7,Fwarned the EU's Made In Europe plans
OL,8,Fposed "a risk to UK manufacturing" and
OL,9,Fsaid he was in talks to get "an
OL,10,Farrangement" that worked for the UK.
OL,11,FThe EU proposals aim to protect EU
OL,12,Findustry from Chinese competitors but
OL,13,Fcould impact British industry and
OL,14,Fsupply chains.
OL,16,FBut Conservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,17,Fsaid the prime minister was "unpicking"
OL,18,Fthe deal the UK signed with the EU.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
