OL,3,AGovernment expands police support to
OL,4,Apolitical figures who are not MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes three months after Reform UK
OL,7,Fspokeswoman and former Conservative MP
OL,8,FAnn Widdecombe was found dead at her
OL,9,Fhome in Devon, having been hit on the
OL,10,Fhead with a hammer 21 times as she ate
OL,11,Flunch.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
